;; de414a57119abef52784d8993e341d53aed635fc2b05c2607d9f98a2c5b72032): Modules/unicodedata.c's _getcode (the names' packed
;; DAWG lookup, the Hangul syllables, the derived names) as \N{...} escapes use it, Copyright (c) 2001 Python Software
